# OP1we Control — narrowly scoped device access.
#
# Grants the active session (uaccess) hidraw access to the verified WE
# series receiver only. Never broadened to all HID or world-write.
# Install (explicit administrator step, milestone 4):
#   sudo install -m 0644 udev/70-op1we-control.rules /etc/udev/rules.d/70-op1we-control.rules
#   sudo udevadm control --reload-rules
# then physically replug the receiver/cable.
#
# Wired PIDs 0x1960/0x1962 (per vendor Cfg.ini) are intentionally NOT
# listed: neither was observed on OP1we hardware in milestone 1
# (docs/device.md). Add the verified wired PID after a wired-mode
# capture, e.g.:
#   KERNEL=="hidraw*", SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="3367", ATTRS{idProduct}=="1962", TAG+="uaccess"
KERNEL=="hidraw*", SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="3367", ATTRS{idProduct}=="1961", TAG+="uaccess"
